{
  "id": "control_valves_for_water_flow___kv_sizing___pressu",
  "title": "Control Valves for Water Flow – Kv Sizing & Pressure Drop Calculations",
  "description": "Control valve sizing and pressure drop calculations for water flow applications. Calculate Kv values based on water flow and pressure drop.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Kv Calculation for Water Control Valves\n\nThis calculator determines the Kv value for water control valves using the formula:\n\n**Kv = q / √(dp)**\n\nWhere:\n- **Kv** = Kv flow coefficient\n- **q** = water flow (m³/h)\n- **dp** = pressure drop (bar)\n\n### Instructions:\n1. Enter the water flow rate in m³/h\n2. Enter the pressure drop in bar\n3. The Kv value will be automatically calculated"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "water_flow",
          "label": "Water Flow",
          "unit": "m³/h",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_drop",
          "label": "Pressure Drop",
          "unit": "bar",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "kv_value",
          "label": "Kv Value",
          "formula": "inputs.water_flow / Math.sqrt(inputs.pressure_drop)",
          "unit": "",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
